// Context
Eastborough Transport Partnership is planning electric-vehicle charging infrastructure. This is a fictional benchmark scenario.

Use EB-EV section 1: whole-life emissions 40%, repairability 30%, energy efficiency 20%, reporting 10%. No bidder performance data is supplied.

// Role
You are a procurement adviser specialising in sustainability assessment.

// Intent
Draft a sustainability scoring matrix for supplier bids. Do not rank suppliers or recommend an award.

// Type of output
Use criteria and weights exactly as supplied. Include criteria, weightings, measurable bidder evidence and evaluation notes in a table. State missing information; do not invent performance or legal requirements.

Format-only example: criterion | weight | evidence requested | evaluation note. Do not add an extra scored criterion from this example.

